# SHA-256 of the prebuilt kitshot-native wheels that `kitshot native --install` may install.
# A wheel not listed here is never installed. After pushing a `native-v<version>` tag,
# .github/workflows/wheels.yml attaches the wheels and SHA256SUMS.txt to that GitHub
# Release: check the release, then copy its SHA256SUMS.txt lines in below.
# Format: `sha256sum` output, "<sha256>  <wheel file name>"; the version is in the name.
# native-v0.2.0 (2026-11-25): hashed after download; matches SHA256SUMS.txt and GitHub's
# asset digests. (facegen-native 0.1.0's wheels are in the native-v0.1.0 release.)
